    "title": "Dilapidated Home Collapses on East Market Street in Mahanoy City - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago A deteriorating home in Mahanoy City completely collapsed late Wednesday evening, spilling debris into the street and prompting a quick response from borough crews. The collapse occurred around 8:15 p.m. at 421 East Market Street, when the vacant, crumbling structure gave way and fell into the roadway and on top of a contractor's van. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
